    DP --> RP[Atomic Nonce and Idempotency]
    RP --> RL[Rate Limit]
    RL -->|Standard| B[Business API]
    RL -->|R-ATF| TS[Contextual Trust Score]
    IC --> TS
    AH[(Allowed Context History)] --> TS
    TS --> P[Allow / Verify / Block]
    P -->|Allow| B
    P -->|Allow only| AH
    M --> AL[(HMAC-Chained Audit Log)]
